<<<
So, when it qualifies adjectives & adverbs, means to such a degree or extent; it is therefore not to be applied to a superlative, as in The difficult & anxious negotiations in which he has taken so foremost a part
===
*So*, when it qualifies adjectives & adverbs, means to such a degree or extent; it is therefore not to be applied to a superlative, as in *The difficult & anxious negotiations in which he has taken so foremost a part*
>>>

